# Dm Bb Gm A7 | Dm Gm Bbm C7: the sad edge. The tune in D minor, the glass harmonica under it an
# octave down, the bowl tolling every bar, no chimes; the borrowed Bb minor turns it home
pattern B
lead      | D5----- E5- F5--- | A5------- G5--- | Bb5--- A5--- G5--- | A5--- G5- F5- E5--- |
lead      | D5----- E5- F5--- | Bb5------- D6--- | Db6--- C6--- Bb5--- | G5------- E5--- |
echo      | .- D5----- E5- F5- | -- A5------- G5- | -- Bb5--- A5--- G5- | -- A5--- G5- F5- E5- |
echo      | -- D5----- E5- F5- | -- Bb5------- D6- | -- Db6--- C6--- Bb5- | -- G5------- E5- |
