# the first strain again, happy: the glass harmonica sings a line above the harp, chimes every
# other bar
pattern A3 from A
glow      | C5----------- | D5----------- | C5----------- | E5----------- |
glow      | C5----------- | F5----------- | Bb4----- E5----- | A4----------- |
chimes    | x... .... .... | _ | x... .... .... | _ |
chimes    | x... .... .... | _ | x... .... .... | _ |

play intro
loop A A2 B A3
